# Versioned delivery

1. Design lives in doc/design/. Roadmaps live in doc/roadmaps/.
2. Product work maps to a milestone version (0.1 = MVP). New capability needs a phase doc first.
3. Naming: m_0.1_mvp.md, phases in m_0.1/p_0.1.1.md …
4. Implement only what the current phase lists. Do not skip ahead or add unplanned scope.
5. After finishing a phase: set that phase status to done; update roadmaps/README.md.
6. 0.x = pre-release. Do not invent parallel doc trees or alternate naming.
